/*
 * Implements validation and construction of string literal values.
 *
 * This module handles:
 *   - UTF-8, UTF-16, and UTF-32 string literal encoding,
 *   - escape-sequence processing,
 *   - suffix-based selection of the output character width,
 *   - and construction of slice values containing the encoded characters.
 *
 * <hr>
